礼堂里我为所有人唱歌。图书馆是所有地方中最好的。","audioResource":"u_056"},{"type":"sentence","text":"I like the sports field best in our school.","translation":"在我们学校，我最喜欢运动场。","audioResource":"u_057"},{"type":"sentence","text":"Where is James? He is in the library.","translation":"詹姆斯在哪里？他在图书馆。","audioResource":"u_058"},{"type":"sentence","text":"Where is Xiaopu? He is on the sports field.","translation":"小浦在哪里？他在运动场上。","audioResource":"u_059"},{"type":"sentence","text":"Shall we meet in the classroom?","translation":"我们在教室里见面好吗？","audioResource":"u_060"},{"type":"sentence","text":"Sure. Let us meet there then.","translation":"好的，那我们在那里见面吧。","audioResource":"u_061"},{"type":"sentence","text":"The classroom has no computers.","translation":"教室里没有电脑。","audioResource":"u_062"},{"type":"sentence","text":"The classroom does not have any computers.","translation":"教室里没有任何电脑。","audioResource":"u_063"},{"type":"sentence","text":"Green School Bali is special.","translation":"巴厘绿色学校很特别。","audioResource":"u_064"},{"type":"sentence","text":"All its school buildings are made of bamboo.","translation":"它所有的教学楼都是用竹子做的。","audioResource":"u_065"},{"type":"sentence","text":"These bamboo buildings have no walls.","translation":"这些竹子建筑没有墙。","audioResource":"u_066"},{"type":"sentence","text":"They look like big umbrellas.","translation":"它们看起来像大伞。","audioResource":"u_067"},{"type":"sentence","text":"Each building has three floors.","translation":"每栋建筑有三层。","audioResource":"u_068"},{"type":"sentence","text":"Students learn and play in bamboo classrooms, computer rooms, music rooms and art rooms.","translation":"学生们在竹子教室、计算机机房、音乐教室和美术教室里学习和玩耍。","audioResource":"u_069"},{"type":"sentence","text":"I like the library in my school best. It is on the ground floor.","translation":"在学校里我最喜欢图书馆。它在一楼。","audioResource":"u_070"},{"type":"sentence","text":"It looks like a boat.","translation":"它看起来像一条船。","audioResource":"u_071"}]},{"title":"五、作文范文 · My favourite place in the school","items":[{"type":"sentence","text":"I like the library in my school best.","translation":"我最喜欢学校里的图书馆。","audioResource":"u_072"},{"type":"sentence","text":"It is on the ground floor.","translation":"它在一楼。","audioResource":"u_073"},{"type":"sentence","text":"It is very special.","translation":"它非常特别。","audioResource":"u_074"},{"type":"sentence","text":"It looks like a boat.","translation":"它看起来像一条船。","audioResource":"u_071"},{"type":"sentence","text":"The room does not have any chairs or desks.","translation":"这个房间里没有任何椅子和桌子。","audioResource":"u_075"},{"type":"sentence","text":"In the library, I read many interesting books.","translation":"在图书馆里，我读许多有趣的书。","audioResource":"u_076"}],"description":"写作思路：1）我最喜欢的地方是哪里 2）它在哪里 3）它有什么特别之处、看起来像什么 4）我在那里做什么"}],"audioProfile":"en-GB-SoniaNeural","audioAccent":"British English","source":"4AU1整理.doc","shortTitle":"Unit 1","order":1,"subtitle":"My school"}]}